<title>UK: BSkyB, Pace up on digital report.</title>
<headline>BSkyB, Pace up on digital report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British Sky Broadcasting Plc were indicated higher on Thursday after a press report that BSkyB will launch its digital satellite television in the UK.</p>
<p>Shares in Pace Micro Technology Plc also rose on a report in the Financial Times said Pace is likely to be one of four suppliers of the decoders needed to receive the channels.</p>
<p>BSkyB shares firmed 3-1/2p to 583-1/2 in pre-market dealings at 0812 GMT, while Pace shares added 6p to 222-1/2.</p>
</text>
